{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world\u2019s gone straight to hell. The surface is a wasteland. Survivors have holed up underground, chasing their last shot at staying alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Wheel of Fate is spinning.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step up! Are you ready to risk it all?\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this savage brawl among survivors, are you the hunter\u2026 or the hunted?\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No more talk! Win or Die. One round settles it all!\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014WARNING: This ain\u2019t no shelter. This is a goddamn death match!\u2014\u2014\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen up, \u201cHunter Game\u201d agent! This place is swarming with desperate, cutthroat bastards.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit them. Arm them. Unleash hell.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/roles.png?t=1744281992\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crack open the armory. Every trigger pull sings a deadly tune.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bullets or blanks? Load up and let fate make the call.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/guns.png?t=1744281992\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The battlefield\u2019s full of wildcard items\u2014one move could flip the whole damn game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/props.png?t=1744281992\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, and those shady-ass organizers? They\u2019re here for blood. Expect curveballs. Expect mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/event.png?t=1744281992\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s only one goal\u2014\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the rules. Wipe out your rivals. Win the ultimate death match!\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And trust me\u2014there\u2019s serious cash in it for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/en_2V2.png?t=1744281992\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Still hesitating? Your gun\u2019s cocked. Luck\u2019s watching.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How will you carve your legend\u2014with blood or fortune?\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring your guts, your brains, and a little bit of luck.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let\u2019s see who makes it out alive!\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Reasons You Can\u2019t Say No to \u201cHunter Game\u201d!\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7A cyberpunk showstopper drenched in destruction and chaos.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7Multiplayer chaos, 3-player deathmatches, story mode, friend mode\u2014challenge the rules of social gaming and rise to the pinnacle of glory.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7A roster of hunters, each with their own deadly style and skills, ready for a brutal showdown.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7Realistic, heart-pounding gunplay that\u2019ll set your adrenaline on fire.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7Crazy, game-changing items that twist fate and keep you coming back for more.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Predator or prey?\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game starts now.\t</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591550?t=1744281992","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/7e1aa5c51c4a0982e20eb406f91d1fe06c250c49/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744281992","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/e15a58c870ab9de8fc3746137c0810e47b6131ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744281992","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/e15a58c870ab9de8fc3746137c0810e47b6131ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744281992","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world\u2019s gone straight to hell. The surface is a wasteland. Survivors have holed up underground, chasing their last shot at staying alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Wheel of Fate is spinning.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step up! Are you ready to risk it all?\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this savage brawl among survivors, are you the hunter\u