oming back for more.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Predator or prey?\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game starts now.\t</p>","developers":["PILI STARSHIP PTE. LTD."],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/65081670b0d71c33988f87eb22ae902224d7086c/header.jpg?t=1744281992","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121216,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121216/movie480.mp4?t=1744281991","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121216/movie_max.mp4?t=1744281991"},"name":"Hunter Roulette The first promotional video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121216/9491aa7c50867c1f9c4022f25a975219e60a8492/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744281991","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121216/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744281991","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121216/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744281991"}}],"name":"Hunter Roulette","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 - 4460, 3.20GHz or above AMD FX - 6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 or AMD Radeon R7 260x (with VRAM of more than 2GB)<br></li><li><strong>Netwo